'''Summon Bestial Rhoa''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied [[Rhoa]] [[minion]]. The skill is solely available through {{il|page=Yriel's Fostering (Rhoa)}} (Bestial Rhoa variant). 

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Rhoa can use a charge attack, and has an [[aura]] that [[intimidate]]s nearby enemies. Like the other [[bestial minion]]s, the Rhoa's hits cannot be evaded.

==Acquisition==
Summon Bestial Rhoa can only be obtained by equipping {{il|page=Yriel's Fostering (Rhoa)}}.

